  "findings": {
    "defaultLoad": "ReloadEnd refreshes base magazine by repeating 炮弹; replacement hooks apply before final list assignment. get_子弹位置=min(count,capacity*2)-1.",
    "defaultMap": "Cannonball 炮弹 maps 小黄远程. Dispatch dictionary CreateSkill(Cannonball.skill) keyed by Cannonball.id, marks right mouse.",
    "defaultPayload": "小黄远程 damage32, r1, 铁弹子弹 speed30 range5.6 Combo1, fan shooter data5 denotes per-index angular step not five projectiles.",
    "payment": "枪 subscribes 技能射击时 and removes affectData count(default1) from selected list position then refreshes UI; selection Cast alone does not remove.",
    "burst": "小黄远程火箭弹 damage24 r2连射 maps 小黄加特林子弹 instant ray range8 lifetime.1 Combo3 shootInterval.1 random-angle shootData6. Native clip Hit.0667 End/Break.3333. Neutral static adoption yields 3 subshots in one response, not one new ammo payment each subshot.",
    "burstLifetime": "async caches skillIndex and count, immediately fires, waits configured interval + attribute, exits on changed castingSkill/skillIndex when keyword技能结束时停止连发.",
    "speed": "主动.计算动画速度 uses 攻速 attribute for zero CD L/R; Hero.BasicAtkSpeed only multiplies left mouse, not right. Includes 动画速度 and Context scale.",
    "reload": "ReloadEnter reads .8 config; ReloadUpdate subtracts deltaTime*上弹速度 and invokes ReloadEnd true. OnCast/DashEnter ReloadPause only clears animation track1. Static methods read do not prove numerical reload timer pause on all actions, preserve approved prototype sample rather than overwrite.",
    "audio": "Exact selected native effect prefabs audio source enabled and PlayOnAwake; defaultfire小黄右键, nativegatling加特林开火; reloadstart小黄上弹1, complete小黄上弹; cannonhit小黄右键命中. Alternatives explicitly not used."
  },
